This repository contains integration scripts, configuration, documentation,
and patches for third-party projects.

- Scripts, configuration and documentation written for this repository: MIT
  (or whichever you pick).
- Patches to DXVK (https://github.com/doitsujin/dxvk): zlib/libpng license,
  the same as DXVK. Binaries built from these patches are modified versions
  of DXVK, not the original.
- Patches to WiVRn (https://github.com/WiVRn/WiVRn): GPL-3.0-or-later, the
  same as WiVRn.

This repository does not relicense the upstream projects.